/**
 * ============================================================
 *  Delta Exchange India  –  Auto Position Closer Bot  (C++)
 * ============================================================
 *  Flow (repeats 24/7):
 *    1. Fetch & display all open positions  (+ raw JSON dump)
 *    2. Ask user for close time  (HH:MM:SS:ms  IST)
 *    3. Live countdown
 *    4. Try Delta's native "close all positions" endpoint first
 *       → On failure: fall back to per-position market orders
 *       → Retry failed orders up to MAX_CLOSE_RETRIES times
 *    5. Wait 2 seconds, then restart from Step 1
 *
 *  Dependencies:
 *    - libcurl          (HTTP requests)
 *    - nlohmann/json    (JSON parsing)
 *    - OpenSSL          (HMAC-SHA256 signing)
 *
 *  Compilation (Linux / macOS):
 *    g++ -std=c++17 -O2 -o delta_close_bot delta_close_bot.cpp \
 *        -lcurl -lssl -lcrypto
 *
 *  Compilation (Windows - MinGW/MSYS2):
 *    g++ -std=c++17 -O2 -o delta_close_bot.exe delta_close_bot.cpp \
 *        -lcurl -lssl -lcrypto -lws2_32
 * ============================================================
 */

